<PolicyPage title="Privacy — Love Mallacoota" description="How Love Mallacoota handles personal information and website data." canonicalPath="/privacy.html" prefix="Your" accent="Privacy" lede="We collect as little personal information as practical and use it only to operate this community service.">
  <h2>Information you choose to send</h2>
  <p>When you submit a correction or enquiry, we receive the contact details and message you provide. We use them to respond, verify the submission and maintain an appropriate record of the change.</p>
  <h2>Website measurement</h2>
  <p>We use basic website analytics to understand which pages are useful. Analytics may record technical details such as browser type, approximate location, referring page and pages visited. We do not use this information to build personal profiles.</p>
  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>Cloudflare delivers and protects the site. EmailJS handles the current contact-form delivery. Embedded Google, YouTube and advertising content may receive technical information when you load or interact with those services.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can contact us to ask what personal information we hold about a submission, request a correction, or request deletion where we do not need to retain it for a legitimate record.</p>
  <p><a href="/contact.html">Send a privacy request</a>.</p>
</PolicyPage>
